# Endgates tip

After **substantive** turns (not thanks/lint/Ask trivia):

```powershell
cd C:\Powercore-repo-main\agent-skills
py -3.13 -m tools.skill_gap.endgates --prompt "USER" --response "ASSISTANT" --auto --plain
```

Before **done/deployed/sellable** on a PowerCore root: also ship-gate (`powercore-ship-gate` skill). Load skill bodies only when debugging scores. Hook runs endgates on stop (metrics; followup off by default).
